WEBVTT

00:02:59.409 --> 00:03:02.666
This woman would have to knock me
completely off course."

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:04.515
I didn't know how right I was.

00:03:04.539 --> 00:03:05.540
(Laughter)

00:03:05.564 --> 00:03:08.529
Our first few months
were like any between young lovers:

00:03:08.553 --> 00:03:12.624
filled with hot, passionate, all-night ...

00:03:12.648 --> 00:03:14.616
AM: nonstop ...

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:15.791
PA: discussions.

00:03:15.815 --> 00:03:16.816
(Laughter)

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:20.217
PA: Aja challenged everything
I knew and understood about the world.

00:03:20.241 --> 00:03:21.635
She forced me --

00:03:21.659 --> 00:03:22.901
AM: lovingly --

00:03:22.925 --> 00:03:25.054
PA: to see our organizing
work with new eyes.

00:03:25.078 --> 00:03:26.801
She helped me see the unseen things

00:03:26.825 --> 00:03:29.079
and how artists illuminate
our interior worlds.

00:03:29.103 --> 00:03:32.334
AM: There were many days
I did not want to get up out of bed